  "notes": "Higher weight = query first / trust faster. Cap 20. Min 1. Sweep on 2026-05-20 added 10 new sources, reweighted 19 existing. Five new advisories: Mini Shai-Hulud May 19 wave (@antv npm + Microsoft durabletask PyPI), TeamPCP GitHub internal-repo breach via poisoned VS Code extension, Langflow unauth RCE (CVE-2026-33017, backfill), Supabase Auth OIDC bypass (CVE-2026-31813, backfill), OpenHands git-diff command injection (CVE-2026-33718, backfill). New pattern this run: worm self-mints valid Sigstore provenance attestations (green badge != safe), and poisoned IDE extensions as a platform-breach vector.",
